{"4863590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Digital Twin: Harmonix", "steam_appid": 4863590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4914790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital Twin: Harmonix is a rhythm roguelike about diving into complex biological simulations, collecting valuable information, and using it to create life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, the game is built around <strong>instrument-style rhythm gameplay</strong>. Notes arrive in complex patterns, and your job is to read, react, and perform using a unique <strong>12-button control scheme</strong>. Each simulation is a playable biological environment, turning living systems into rhythm charts filled with color, motion, and strange organic energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run gives you a chance to gather data and recover DNA from the environment. The better you perform, the more you can bring back to the lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, use the DNA you have collected to assemble new creatures. Experiment with different genetic combinations, discover new traits, and create organisms that change how you approach future simulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part rhythm game, part roguelike progression system, and part psychedelic biology experiment, Digital Twin: Harmonix<strong> </strong>is about mastering the music of living systems and using what you find to create something new.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital Twin: Harmonix is a rhythm roguelike about diving into complex biological simulations, collecting valuable information, and using it to create life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, the game is built around <strong>instrument-style rhythm gameplay</strong>. Notes arrive in complex patterns, and your job is to read, react, and perform using a unique <strong>12-button control scheme</strong>. Each simulation is a playable biological environment, turning living systems 